# Python Environment

Use the `streambed` conda environment for Python commands in this repository.

Examples:

```bash
conda run -n streambed python -m pytest tests/unit
conda run -n streambed python path/to/script.py
```

Avoid relying on the system `python3` for tests; it may not have the project dependencies.

# Test Failure Logs

Docker/integration test failure logs are written under `tests/logs/`.
When a Docker test fails, inspect the relevant timestamped log there before guessing from pytest output alone.
